# SoundPlant demo: house, 122 BPM, A minor. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# Deep house in A minor, 92 bars. One drone (A + E) fits every chord, the bass moves under a few shared upper voicings.
# T1 kit  T2 rayon dx bass  T3 bellows gospel organ  T4 rayon keys (the call)  T5 cane koto (arp player)
# T6 voile whisper pad (texture)  T7 rayon glass bell (ear candy)  T8 voile vocal chop (ah-oh)
# Song: intro 8, verse 8, pre 4, drop 16, break 4 + walk-down 4, the drop withheld 4, drop 2 16 (the bass takes the
# hook), bridge 8 (Dm9 Bbmaj9 Fmaj7 G9sus4), final drop 12, outro 8 (the call on the keys, alone).
bpm 122
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 9
knob 9 e3 1

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the kit: a round kick, a clap into the room, short hats, a soft shaker
knob 1 d1.k1 70
knob 1 d1.k2 56
knob 1 d1.k3 74
knob 1 d1.k4 62
knob 1 d1.volume 92
knob 1 d5.k4 54
knob 1 d5.volume 72
knob 1 d5.send2 40
knob 1 d3.volume 54
knob 1 d4.k2 70
knob 1 d4.volume 58
knob 1 d9.volume 50
knob 1 d9.send1 16
knob 1 d6.volume 62
knob 1 d7.volume 60
knob 1 d8.volume 56
knob 1 d8.send1 24
knob 1 d2.volume 72
knob 1 d2.send2 34
knob 1 level 100
# T2 rayon dx bass: ducked by the kick
preset 2 dx_bass rayon
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 cut 82
knob 2 ltype pump
knob 2 lspeed track_1
knob 2 lamt 46
knob 2 level 102
# T3 bellows gospel: the chords, stabbed on the offbeats in the drops
preset 3 gospel bellows
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 level 74
knob 3 pan 56
knob 3 send1 14
knob 3 send2 26
# T4 rayon keys: the electric piano that carries the call, in the echo and the room
preset 4 rayon rayon
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain no
knob 4 d 64
knob 4 level 88
knob 4 pan 58
knob 4 send1 30
knob 4 send2 24
# T5 cane koto through the arp player: sixteenth plucks that bounce up two octaves, wide
preset 5 koto cane
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 player arp
knob 5 p1 1/16
knob 5 p2 bounce
knob 5 p3 2
knob 5 ap1 short
knob 5 ap4 wide
knob 5 level 62
knob 5 pan 84
knob 5 send1 40
knob 5 send2 30
# T6 voile whisper pad: the texture, a breath held under everything, pumped by the kick
preset 6 whisper_pad voile
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain no
knob 6 ltype pump
knob 6 lspeed track_1
knob 6 lamt 64
knob 6 level 60
knob 6 pan 72
knob 6 send2 54
# T7 rayon glass bell: ear candy in the hall
preset 7 glass_bell rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain no
knob 7 level 70
knob 7 pan 38
knob 7 send1 30
knob 7 send2 56
# T8 voile vocal chop: the ah-oh
preset 8 vocal_chop voile
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 brain no
knob 8 level 78
knob 8 pan 64
knob 8 send1 38
knob 8 send2 28
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, FX II a hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 52
knob 11 e4 50
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 76
knob 12 e3 50
mst lo 62
mst hi 58
mst comp 58
mst pump 24
mst pumpby kick
mst release 68
mst level 104
groove swing

