# ---- scenes and the song: the mask is T1..T8, COND, THROW; x = muted
# intro A: the kick, the pad opening, the bell motif, a held ah
scenedef 1 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 3 1 1
scenemute 1 .xxxx.....
# intro B: the bass and the keys comp come in
scenedef 2 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 3 1 1
scenemute 2 ..x.x.....
# verse A: Am9 Dm9, the chop pickups climb E G A B
scenedef 3 1 1 1 1 1 2 1 1 1 1
scenemute 3 ..x.x.x...
# verse B: the koto, the bell pickups, the ah-oh
scenedef 4 1 1 1 1 1 2 3 2 1 1
scenemute 4 ..x.......
# pre: the call breaks off, the bass climbs, the filter opens, the snare rolls
scenedef 5 4 2 1 4 2 1 2 1 1 2
scenemute 5 ....x..x..
# drop A: the call, the stabs, the bass
scenedef 6 1 3 2 2 2 2 3 2 1 1
scenemute 6 ....x.xx..
# drop B: the koto and the chop join
scenedef 7 1 3 2 2 2 2 3 2 1 1
scenemute 7 ......x...
# drop C: fills, the call with its pickups and its answer
scenedef 8 5 3 2 3 2 2 3 2 1 1
scenemute 8 ..........
# drop D: busier stabs and chop, the echo at the end
scenedef 9 5 3 5 3 2 2 3 4 1 3
scenemute 9 ..........
# break: no kick, an A pedal, the chords over it, the bells sing
scenedef 10 3 4 6 5 3 2 4 3 1 1
scenemute 10 ....x.....
# walk-down: Am9 G6 Fmaj7 E7sus4, the pad opens, the chop climbs
scenedef 11 6 5 7 5 1 1 2 1 1 4
scenemute 11 ...xx.....
# withheld: the drop with no kick and no bass, a snare roll
scenedef 12 8 1 2 2 2 2 3 2 1 3
scenemute 12 .x........
# drop 2 A: the bass takes the hook, the keys sit out
scenedef 13 1 6 2 2 2 2 3 2 1 1
scenemute 13 ...x..x...
# drop 2 B: the call returns over the bass hook, busier stabs and chop
scenedef 14 5 6 5 2 2 2 3 4 1 1
scenemute 14 ......x...
# drop 2 C: the call over the bass hook
scenedef 15 5 6 2 3 2 2 3 4 1 1
scenemute 15 ..........
# drop 2 D: the drive bass again, the echo at the end
scenedef 16 5 3 5 3 2 2 3 4 1 3
scenemute 16 ..........
# bridge A: Dm9 Bbmaj9 Fmaj7 G9sus4, a slow tune, no kick
scenedef 17 3 7 3 6 3 3 4 3 1 1
scenemute 17 ....x.....
# bridge B: the kick returns, the bass pulses on E, the build
scenedef 18 6 8 4 7 3 3 4 3 1 2
scenemute 18 ..........
# final drop A
scenedef 19 5 3 5 3 2 2 3 4 1 1
scenemute 19 ..........
# final drop B: the bass hook, the intro bells ring overhead
scenedef 20 5 6 5 3 2 2 5 4 1 1
scenemute 20 ..........
# final drop C: everything, the echo out
scenedef 21 5 6 5 3 2 2 3 4 1 3
scenemute 21 ..........
# outro A: the kick thins, the vamp, the bells
scenedef 22 7 1 8 1 1 2 5 3 1 1
scenemute 22 ..x.......
# outro B: the keys alone, the call, the answer, the chord rings
scenedef 23 1 1 1 8 1 2 5 3 1 1
scenemute 23 xxx.x..x..
